Koda bundles a curated subset of Anthropic's open-source Agent Skills.

These skills are sourced from https://github.com/anthropics/skills and are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Each skill folder retains its
original LICENSE.txt; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for upstream attribution.

The office-document skills (docx, pdf, pptx, xlsx) from that repository are
source-available (not open source) and are deliberately NOT bundled here.

Skills are unmodified copies of their upstream sources.
